<title>USA: Lexington Q1 shr $0.15 after charge.</title>
<headline>Lexington Q1 shr $0.15 after charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>LEXINGTON CORPORATE PROPERTIES INC.</p>
<p>				AND CONSOLIDATED SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>					  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Revenues			  $9,824,207  $6,799,356</p>
<p>Income from continuing</p>
<p> operations			 1,841,178   1,874,190</p>
<p>Net income			 $1,510,450  $1,673,445</p>
<p>Stock compensation			 --     147,066</p>
<p>Total funds from operations(A)4,301,723   3,439,257</p>
<p>Funds from operations</p>
<p> (shares only)(D)		 3,685,591   3,383,648</p>
