<p>Income before minority</p>
<p> interest(C)			    $0.14	 $0.18</p>
<p>Net income(D)			   $0.15	 $0.18</p>
<p>Total funds from operations(A)(C) $0.34	 $0.35</p>
<p>Funds from operations</p>
<p> (shares only)(D)		     $0.37	 $0.36</p>
